<title>JAPAN: Heiwa Construction - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Heiwa Construction - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.82		vs	    5.28</p>
<p> Operating	  184    million	  vs	  257    million</p>
<p> Current	    176    million	  vs	  264    million</p>
<p> Net		   89    million	  vs	  154    million</p>
<p> EPS		   17.44 yen	  vs	   36.55 yen</p>
<p> Shares		5 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p>NOTE - Heiwa Construction Co Ltd is a general construction concern specialising in road pavement and condominium construction.</p>
